      "text": "[6:43AM] #LagIbdExpWay\n#3MB\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nTraffic is still very encouraging coming inward Berger from Kara bridge enroute Otedola bridge and Tollgate.\nIt's a bit steady at 7up, Ogudu and Iyana Oworo due to bus stop activities.\n\nThe stretch of Third mainland bridge is still good to go.\nConnecting Osborne road through Dolphin is moving steadily.\n#FollowLASTMA",
